        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 9:4",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that Akish sought the life of his father-in-law; and he applied unto those whom he had sworn by the oath of the ancients, and they obtained the head of his father-in-law, as he sat upon his throne, giving audience to his people.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 31,
            "end": 37,
            "text": "Esth. 2:21."
          },
