        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "For so great had been the spreading of this wicked and secret society that it had corrupted the hearts of all the people; therefore Jared was murdered upon his throne, and Akish reigned in his stead.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 9:6",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that Akish began to be jealous of his son, therefore he shut him up in prison, and kept him upon little or no food until he had suffered death.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 43,
            "end": 50,
            "text": "TG Jealous."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
