        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 27
      },
      {
        "text": "And there came prophets in the land again, crying repentance unto them—that they must prepare the way of the Lord or there should come a curse upon the face of the land; yea, even there should be a great famine, in which they should be destroyed if they did not repent.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
